{"format":"coupole-schema/1","id":"canon_newton","taille":[640,560],"titre":{"fr":"Le canon de Newton","en":"Newton's cannon"},"alt":{"fr":"Une montagne (très exagérée) sur un astre ; un canon tire à l'horizontale de plus en plus vite. Lentement, le boulet retombe ; à la vitesse de satellisation v₁, il fait le tour sans toucher le sol ; un peu plus vite, il décrit une ellipse dont le canon est le point le plus bas ; à v₂ = √2 v₁, il s'échappe.","en":"A mountain (greatly exaggerated) on a body; a cannon fires horizontally, faster and faster. Slowly, the ball falls back; at the orbital speed v₁ it goes round without touching the ground; a little faster, it traces an ellipse whose lowest point is the cannon; at v₂ = √2 v₁ it escapes."},"elements":[{"t":"cercle","c":[300,290],"r":120,"style":{"trait":null,"fond":"terre","ep":1.5}},{"t":"poly","p":[[280.8,171.56],[300,148.4],[319.2,171.56]],"ferme":true,"style":{"trait":"trait","fond":"fin","ep":1}},{"t":"poly","p":[[300.0,148.4],[300.97,148.41],[301.94,148.44],[302.92,148.5],[303.89,148.58],[304.86,148.68],[305.83,148.8],[306.8,148.94],[307.76,149.11],[308.73,149.29],[309.7,149.5],[310.66,149.74],[311.62,149.99],[312.58,150.27],[313.54,150.57],[314.5,150.89],[315.45,151.23],[316.4,151.6],[317.35,151.99],[318.29,152.4],[319.24,152.84],[320.18,153.3],[321.11,153.78],[322.04,154.28],[322.97,154.81],[323.9,155.36],[324.82,155.93],[325.74,156.53],[326.65,157.15],[327.55,157.79],[328.46,158.46],[329.35,159.15],[330.24,159.87],[331.13,160.6],[332.01,161.37],[332.88,162.16],[333.75,162.97],[334.61,163.81],[335.47,164.67],[336.31,165.56],[337.15,166.47],[337.99,167.41],[338.81,168.37],[339.63,169.36],[340.43,170.38],[341.23,171.42],[342.02,172.49],[342.8,173.59],[343.57,174.71],[344.33,175.86],[345.08,177.03],[345.82,178.24],[346.57,179.41],[346.57,179.41]],"ferme":false,"style":{"trait":"accent3","fond":null,"ep":2}},{"t":"poly","p":[[300.0,148.4],[301.41,148.41],[302.83,148.44],[304.24,148.5],[305.65,148.58],[307.07,148.68],[3